WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.829
Watch and read: For your describing practice, choose a describing word for the mango.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.073
The answer is: yellow. A describing word tells us more about an object.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:15.599
Watch and read: For your pronunciation practice, you say the word “cat”. What is the

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:16.219
best answer?

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:22.011
The answer is: Say its sounds clearly. Read the instruction carefully and choose the

00:00:22.011 --> 00:00:23.433
helpful or correct response.
